(
 'Returns the tag number of the latest release.'
 'Drafts are ignored.'
 ''
 'The project must be hosted on GitHub.'
 ''
 'The name of the repository is taken from the Cider project the given folder belongs to.'
 'If the folder is not an open Cider project the name of the folder is used instead.'
 ''
 '-verbose    If specified the date of the commit & the caption of the release are returned as well'
 '-username=  The GitHub username the repository belongs to. By default it is taken from the'
 '            project_url of the Cider project, so for a folder that is not an open Cider'
 '            project you must specify this.'
)
